      "writtenOn": "2023-05-18T16:39:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have to rebind if the uniform buffer doesn\u0027t change? I thought in Vulkan we could rebind the pipeline and the descriptor sets would remain valid. The only reason for a rebind that I\u0027m aware of is if you change a descriptor set with a low slot number -- then you need to rebind all the following ones.",
