      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T20:19:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You would be correct. Removed\nIt seems like so long as 2 pipelines have the same pipeline layout, no descriptor sets needs to be re-bound. So, the sets can stay bound until they need to be changed (which a draw command would indicate), or once we are ready to draw and some later sets are just no longer needed and, I believe, can just be ignored.",
